  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IISD-GSI support for Fossil Fuel Subsidy Reform and Clean Energy Transition, and BOGA secretariat</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Objective for IISD-GDI support for FFSR and Clean Energy Transition: Reduced greenhouse gas emissions from accelerated transition to clean energy, and other benefits including increased energy security, via fossil fuel subsidy reform, taxation and increased investment in clean energy from governments and private sector.

Objective for the BOGA secretariat: To support developing (ODA recipient) countries with commercially extractable oil and gas reserves in transitioning away from oil and gas exploration and production, which would enable BOGA Membership.</narrative>
  </description>
